WEBVTT

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.740
Now we can start playing
water polo together!

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.330
Uh...

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.290
Yes!

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.090
Water Polo

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.150
You sure we can't convince you?

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.740
You promised not to bug me.

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:54.910
You don't want to swim now
'cuz you beat your brother?

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.830
Uh, it's just--

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:05.750
I heard from a guy on your swim team
that you joined to beat your brother.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:07.800
Unbelievable.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.380
You beat him and burned out?

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:12.590
I never beat him.

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:22.810
Though he's someone I respect, I joined
the swim team to surpass my brother.

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:26.570
No matter the sport,
he was always better than me.

00:01:28.730 --> 00:01:33.240
But only in swimming did I come close.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.320
{=0}OM Swimming School

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:41.580
When I thought I was close to beating him,

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:45.210
he went to junior high
and joined water polo.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:51.760
I kept swimming,
thinking he'd return to it...

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:54.260
...but in the end, he didn't.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.340
OM Swimming School

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:03.560
Though I surpassed his grade school
record, it hadn't felt like I won.

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:08.820
I wanted to beat him
in person, but I couldn't.

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:13.110
So, regretfully, I quit swimming club.

00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:18.240
The end.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:19.740
Amihama!

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:26.630
But you don't hate swimming, right?

00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:28.960
That's none of your business.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.510
Ooh! Swimsuits!

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:39.630
It's been a while.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.270
Yo.

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:43.100
Huh? You're...

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:44.940
Senpai!

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:47.190
Hey! Thanks for the message!

00:02:47.190 --> 00:02:48.440
Of course!

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:53.030
We heard from Eitaro that you picked up
water polo, so we came to--

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:57.240
Don't just come waltzing in! Who are you?

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:00.410
Oh. Sorry, you're right. We're--

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:05.960
No worries! We're honored to
get visitors from Shogakukan!

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:08.170
Shogakukan?

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:14.380
They're Minato's old teammates
and last year's Interhigh champs!

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:17.180
So, they're our rivals?

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:20.850
That's enough outta you!
Go take a bath!

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:23.100
You're being pathetic!

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:26.060
Uh... Um...

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.900
We just wanted to see
if you were really back.

00:03:29.900 --> 00:03:34.190
It's good to see him in
his suit again. Right?

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.650
Mmm.

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.240
Yeah.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.530
Senpai...

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:43.450
If you're playing again,
do you remember us now?

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:47.250
That remains the same as before.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.330
Remains?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.500
Isn't that a rule name?

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:56.340
That's the old term. It's "offsides" now.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.930
Really?

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:01.930
Anyway, I only remember through 6th grade.

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:05.850
It's like I'm stuck in the past.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:13.400
If my memory doesn't come back,
maybe I'll remain like this forever.

00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:15.230
Not "remain."

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:21.120
Re-Main.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:21.910
Huh?

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:25.450
Be main again! Re-Main!

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:29.330
You were always our main man!

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:33.710
I'll wait for you to be the player
I know you can be!

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.920
Thanks.

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:42.550
I won't stop you from being cheesy,
but quit blushing.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:44.140
Shuddap.

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:46.100
We can't play, though.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.180
Huh?

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:53.520
We don't have seven people. We had
someone in mind, but he didn't join.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.900
So we can't...

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.740
Hold on.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:02.320
If you mean me, I'm still here.

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.530
Huh?

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:05.240
Didn't you leave?

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.250
Actually, I was right there.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:15.290
After overhearing that, I changed
my mind--I'll join water polo.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.250
Huh?

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.170
For real?!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.010
Thanks!

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:23.970
Well, that's good news, I guess.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.850
Yeah.

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:28.770
You should be thanking them.

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:33.190
I've been inspired to challenge
my brother again.

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:36.440
Long time no see, Brother.

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:37.360
Yeah.

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:38.570
Huh?

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:40.530
Brother?!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.990
What?!

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:21.500
One, two, three, four, five,
six, seven, eight...!

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:22.380
Episode 4:            This Ain't Looking Good...

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:25.010
Two, two, three, four, five...!

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:29.970
None of us saw that one coming, but...

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:34.020
Say, why did you--?

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:38.150
If my brother so eagerly
awaits your return,

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:40.900
I might actually beat him with you.

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:43.570
It made me want to play together.

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:47.400
Talk about pressure...

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:52.160
But the champs of Japan
were saying that about me...

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:54.830
I'm a prodigy! I've got this!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:57.910
{=3}Wishing for 7 members

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:05.090
Now, the fun begins.

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:10.090
In water polo, you shoot
a ball at a floating goal.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:14.350
Unlike basketball,
all shots only get one point.

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:20.150
The fights for the ball are so fierce,
some call it "water wrestling."

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:23.070
These hats protect your ears.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:27.490
Your eardrums might rupture
without 'em, so be careful.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:33.330
Since the pool is deep, you've gotta do
an eggbeater kick to stay afloat.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:40.210
Make a figure eight with your legs,
kicking clockwise and counterclockwise.

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:43.920
While paddling your arms
in and out, in and out.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:49.720
If you can't do this in your sleep,
keep practicing till you can.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.450
Five seconds!

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:25.960
N-Not good!

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:29.840
I'm a prodigy! I'm a--!

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:36.810
Our neighbors...

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:38.890
They're playing again.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:42.440
Either way, they're just
a bunch of scrubs.

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:44.440
That'll be fun.

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:49.150
Uh, Captain?

00:09:50.900 --> 00:09:53.160
Do me a favor.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:59.750
Well, that's it for practice! Good work!

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:01.910
--Yeah...
--Good work...

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:19.390
I feel like marmalade.

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:23.480
My muscles turned into jam.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.060
Yeah.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:32.950
I'm beat.

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:40.490
I see. If you're joining, we'll have
to watch out for you guys.

00:10:53.470 --> 00:10:54.930
Make sure to chew!

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:56.260
Mmm.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:04.060
Delish!

00:11:13.270 --> 00:11:17.900
{=4}Get 1st Win

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:44.980
It's only 2nd period.

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:47.690
I'm always hungry lately.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:57.990
Okay, next!

00:11:57.990 --> 00:11:59.110
Right!

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.080
Here goes!

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:13.250
That was close!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:22.100
Wish I could score.
I just don't have the feel for it.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:24.850
You've got some serious talent!

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:27.140
Talent... Really?

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:30.850
Yeah! Your shots are like bullets!

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:34.230
Well, I've got a strong arm from baseball.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:37.320
What club were you two in in junior high?

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:38.400
Huh?

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.910
Minato and Ei were in water polo
and Amiami swam.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:43.780
Amiami?

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:44.830
Well?

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.790
I did calligraphy.

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:47.960
Yeah?

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:49.920
You can write pretty?

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:50.670
Yeah.

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.840
That's cool!

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:56.960
I always went home
and made sweets instead.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.260
Sweets?

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:01.300
My dad's a pâtissier.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:06.770
I hope to be one, too, but he
wants me to finish school first.

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:07.930
--Oh?
--Yeah?

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:11.350
So, the pâtissier quote you said...?

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.360
Yeah, my father's.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.070
I see!

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.070
What about you, Captain?

00:13:17.070 --> 00:13:19.740
Huh? Uh, same as him.

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:20.610
You made sweets?

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.660
Not that!

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:25.580
I went home, too.

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:26.830
Surprising.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:32.370
So what drove you to restart
the water polo club?

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:35.540
The power of love, I guess.

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:36.880
Huh?

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:39.380
That deserves another.

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.590
Huh?!

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.260
Even Amiami chimed in.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.220
Amiami...

00:13:44.220 --> 00:13:46.760
C'mon, don't make fun!

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:51.100
Does a girl you like play
water polo or something?

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:52.390
Or something!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.230
The hell--?!

00:13:53.230 --> 00:13:55.270
Who really cares?!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.610
This guy...

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:58.980
What a sad bunch.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:03.490
Don't choose a club 'cuz they're big
or not. Join 'cuz you want to.

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:08.990
My first impression of someone
has never been more wrong.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:13.750
Anyway, I wanna make sure
we're strong as hell!

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:19.000
Therefore... this Saturday,
I set up a practice match!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:19.920
--Huh?!
--What?!

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:25.970
Prefecturals are coming up! Learning
from a real match is more our style!

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.970
A match...

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.470
Against who?

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:31.640
You'll have to wait and see.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:32.560
--Huh?!
--What?!

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:34.690
Isn't that more exciting?!

00:14:34.690 --> 00:14:38.110
Is it... Shogakukan?!

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:40.190
Against my brother?!

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.110
You'll see!

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:47.910
Whoa! I'm pumped up!

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:51.410
A match... It's a first for me.

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:53.120
Me, too.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:58.000
All right! Lez do this!

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:03.420
Uh, I used to talk like that.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.550
I like it! C'mon, all together!

